  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Private Plunge Pool | Community Pool | Bicycles | Beach Access<br><br>Escape to coastal luxury at \"Hidden Tides\", proudly managed by Beach Getaways, is nestled in the serene, gated Treetop Village community of Seacrest Beach. Perfectly crafted for families and groups, this spacious retreat features its very own private plunge pool—the ultimate spot to cool off or lounge under the sun in total privacy. From the welcoming front porch swing to the breezy screened-in back patio ideal for group dinners or evening cocktails, every detail of this home invites relaxation. Enjoy access to the Treetop Village community pool and the renowned Seacrest Beach access, just a short ride or stroll away. Whether you're lounging by your private pool, biking along 30A or making memories on the sand, Hidden Tides is your dream escape brought to life. Book your stay today and experience Seacrest Beach like never before.<br><br>Experience the Beach Getaways Heart of Hospitality: Providing Happy Connections and Lasting Memories!<br><br>First Floor<br>Kitchen & Dining Areas<br> • Granite Countertops<br> • Stainless Steel Appliances<br> • Dining Table w/ Seating for 6<br> • Fully Equipped w/Cookware, Crockpot, Blender, Dishes, Utensils & Drinkware<br><br>Living Area<br> • Plenty of Comfortable Seating<br> • Flat Screen TV & DVD Player<br> • Ceiling Fan, Side Tables, Lamps<br> • Half Bath<br> <br>2nd Floor<br>Primary Bedroom<br> • King Size Bed<br> • Ceiling Fan, Side Tables, Lamps and Flat Screen TV<br> • En-Suite Bath with Walk-In Shower<br><br>Guest Room 2<br> • 2 Full Size Beds<br> • Ceiling Fan, Side Tables, Lamps and Flat Screen TV<br> • Full Guest Bath with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>Guest Room 3<br> • Full Size Bunk Bed Sets<br><br>3rd Floor<br>Guest Room 1<br> • King Size Bed<br> • Ceiling Fan, Side Tables, Lamps and Flat Screen TV<br> • En-Suite Full Bath w/Walk-In Shower & Double Sink Vanity<br><br>Loft Area<br> • Queen Size Sleeper Sofa<br> • Ceiling Fan, Desk and Flat Screen TV<br> • Screened-In Balcony<br> • Washer & Dryer<br><br>Additional Amenities Include<br> • Free Wifi<br> • Washer & Dryer in Home<br> • Front Porch Swing<br> • Beach Chairs & Buggy, Toys, Cornhole & more<br> • 4 Bicycles<br> • Private Plunge Pool<br> • Community Pool<br> • Seacrest Beach Access<br> • Seasonal Beach Tram Service (March 1 - October 31)<br><br>You're just a walk away from the shops and restaurants of the Villages of South Walton & Rosemary Beach. You can rent bikes, shop, jumpstart your morning with a coffee or relax with an evening cocktail while the kids enjoy an ice cream. During spring & summer, you'll find live outdoor entertainment.<br><br>*A short drive to Destin, Seaside, Panama City Beach, Frank Brown Park, Pier Park, Gulf World and much more family fun!<br><br>*Rosemary Beach Farmers Market every Sunday featuring local artisans and incredible food!<br><br>*Snorkel Tours *Charter Fishing *Dolphin Cruises *Local Winery *Amazing Restaurants *Shopping *Kayaking *World Renowned Golf Courses *MORE!<br><br>Policies:<br> 1.\tCheck-in is 4pm | Check-out is 10am.<br> 2.\tNo Smoking in the home or on balcony/deck.<br> 3.\tPets are not allowed.<br> 4.\tLoud parties or gatherings will not be tolerated.<br> 5. Cars MUST be parked in the driveway, street parking is not permitted. Parking passes (limit 2) can be found on the kitchen counter and MUST be displayed in the windshield.<br> 6.\tMust be at least 25 years old to rent. For groups of Single Adults, all guests in the group must be at least 25 years of age and proof of age will be required before approving the reservation.<br> 7. Please Note: Exterior security cameras are present and in place at the front and back of the home for added safety monitoring. Rest assured, your privacy is paramount, and no cameras are installed inside the living areas. <br><br>Locally Managed by:<br>My Beach Getaways<br>Beaches of Alabama & Florida Gulf Coast",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
